  "text": "Elemental scamps are bat-like critters marked by elemental powers. Water scamps are marked apart from other scamps by sleek fur that traps a layer of water next to their skin. Although they can fly like their kin and conjure enough water to never dry out, water scamps leave the water only when they must."
